OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police chief inspector     
OL,4,Ajailed for rape                        
OL,6,FA former police chief inspector who    
OL,7,Fonce worked with convicted murderer    
OL,8,FWayne Couzens has been sentenced to    
OL,9,F10-and-a-half years in prison for two  
OL,10,Fcounts of rape and one of sexual       
OL,11,Fassault.                               
OL,13,FGlen Mahony, 54, who was convicted at  
OL,14,FMaidstone Crown Court in September     
OL,15,Ffollowing a 10-day trial, carried out  
OL,16,Ftwo attacks while his victim was       
OL,17,Fasleep.                                
