OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police chief inspector     
OL,4,Ajailed for rape                        
OL,6,FMahony worked in the Civil Nuclear     
OL,7,FConstabulary (CNC) and previously      
OL,8,Fworked with Couzens, who is serving a  
OL,9,Fwhole life tariff for the rape and     
OL,10,Fmurder of Sarah Everard in 2021.       
OL,12,FIn his sentencing remarks on Tuesday,  
OL,13,FJudge Gareth Branston dismissed        
OL,14,FMahony's claims that he was targeted   
OL,15,Fbecause he had once managed Couzens.   
